notes: |
  Migration target for the RoadmapBench NSCC runtime.
  OpenClaw v2026.9.2 already contains native rolling tool-loop detection and
  the post-compaction loop guard, so the Agent_Bench v2026.4.22 loop-guard
  backport must not be reapplied to this runtime.
  Before porting the remaining NSCC bridge/measurement patches, run
  agent_bench/deployments/pbs/audit_oc_v2026_9_2.sh against the base SIF to
  resolve the compiled bundle anchors in the released container.
